Restore Nazgrek Items
    Events
    Conditions
    Actions
        Set VariableSet NazgrekCurPos = (Position of Nazgrek)
        Sound - Play ItemRestore <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to Nazgrek
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
            Then - Actions
                Item - Pick every item in NazgrekDeathRegion and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        Item - Move (Picked item) to NazgrekCurPos
                Set VariableSet RestoreItemsPossibleN = False
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_NazgrekCurPos)
            Else - Actions
        Unit - Change ownership of SpiritHealer to Neutral Hostile and Retain color
        Unit - Order SpiritHealer to Neutral Alchemist - Acid Bomb Nazgrek
        Wait 0.50 seconds
        Unit - Change ownership of SpiritHealer to Neutral Passive and Retain color
        Sound - Play SpiritHealerResSickness <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to Nazgrek
        Countdown Timer - Resume SpiritHealerRevealTimer
        Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode Off for (All players)
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
